# The web app is on React 18 and the mobile app (Expo SDK 56) is on React 19, so
# the workspace has two @types/react versions. Don't hoist them into the shared
# virtual store — otherwise the higher version leaks into the other app's compile
# and breaks JSX typings (every component "cannot be used as a JSX component").
# Each app then resolves its own @types/react from its direct dependency.
hoist-pattern[]=*
hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react
hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react-dom
